# paint and gpu_render of a GPU list [f32]: a short one is a uniform, a longer one a storage array (cards paint-gpu-f32, gpu-list-inference)
'c: [f32] = [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]; gpu_render("@fragment fn main() -> @location(0) vec4f { return values.c; }", 2, 1, {c: c})'	[4294901760, 4294901760]
# a list of four numbers made for the GPU alone, inferred a GPU list [f32] (card gpu-list-inference), is the same uniform
